/Title (CAPES has signed an MoU with the University of Okara to strengthen academic and research collaboration. This partnership aims to create opportunities for researchers and students to engage in critical dialogue and joint research initiatives. The MoU was signed by Dr. Ekaterina Gavrishyk, Director of External Linkages, University of Okara, and Dr. Gul-i-Ayesha Bhatti, Director of the Eurasia Chapter, CAPES.)
